"text": "If Bugman shrunk down and crawled inside the Purple Guy's body, then suddenly grew back to normal size, would it pop him like a giant purple water balloon? Well, growing bigger doesn't mean Bugman creates unlimited force. And if Purple Guy is nearly impossible to damage from the outside, well his insides are probably insanely durable too. So as Bugman expands, Purple Guy's body would push back. And if that pressure is stronger than Bugman's ability to grow, well, it wouldn't end well for him. But if Metal Man could make Purple Guy bleed from the outside, then his organs probably aren't made of solid steel. So Bugman might only need to expand enough to rupture something important, then shrink back down and crawl out.",
